The sequence to get weapons:  Sacrafice again and again and never pray.
When you receive a weapon gift your prayer timeout is reset above zero
and it is no longer safe to pray.

The sequence to get maximum spellbooks: Sacrafice until you get a
feeling of reconcilliation, to reduce your prayer timeout to zero.
Sacrafice more until you no longer see any closers, to maximize your
luck.  Have a b/u luckstone to keep your luck at maximum.  Then pray
and hope you get a spellbook.

Praying at maximum luck has an additional problem, though.  The first
time your random number is high enough you will be crowned and your
prayer timeout will be larger.  But every subesquent time you've
already been crowned so it falls through to getting a spellbook.  If
you play games with exact luck values you also increase the chances of
getting the other benefits of prayer that you may consider less
valuable than a spellbook.

